            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system for monitoring an approach to a target comprising a luminal device including a distal portion and configured to be inserted into a patient's airways, the distal portion of the luminal device configured to be guided proximate the target; a surgical instrument configured to be guided through the luminal device; a sensor coupled to the luminal device or the surgical instrument; and one or more indicators having a detectable property located along at least a portion of the surgical instrument or the luminal device; wherein the sensor is configured to sense the detectable property of the one or more indicators.</p>
            </abstract>
